-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Leung</surname><given-names>TW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Domestic violence and postnatal depression in a Chinese community</article-title><source>Int J Gynaecol Obstet</source><year>2002</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>66</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12427403</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b7"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gazmararian</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Petersen</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Spitz</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Goodwin</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Saltzman</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name><name><surname>Marks</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Violence and reproductive health: current knowledge and future research directions</article-title><source>Matern Child Health J</source><year>2000</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>79</fpage><lpage>84</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10994575</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tiwari</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>DY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>KL</given-names></name><name><surname>Leung</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identifying intimate partner violence: comparing the Chinese abuse assessment screen with the Chinese revised conflict tactics scales</article-title><source>BJOG</source><year>2007</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>1065</fpage><